        "original_id": "22116e00-4e3d-5fbe-9bcf-befd1418991e",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Rocket Raccoon, Paul McCartney, John Lennon, Donovan\n- Works: \"Rocky Raccoon\"\n- Music Groups: The Beatles\n- Places: India\n- Topics: character inspiration, songwriting\n\nFacts:\n- In 1968, The Beatles released the song \"Rocky Raccoon.\"\n- Paul McCartney primarily wrote \"Rocky Raccoon.\"\n- Paul McCartney was inspired to write \"Rocky Raccoon\" while playing acoustic guitar with John Lennon and Donovan in India during the Beatles' retreat there.\n- Rocket Raccoon's name and aspects of Rocket Raccoon's character are a nod to The Beatles' 1968 song \"Rocky Raccoon.\"",
